  "INQ-D4E5F6": {intent:"pricing",confidence:0.72,draft:"Hi David! Thanks for your interest in Seagrove Cottage. Our rates are set through the platform and reflect peak demand for the 30A area. We'd love to host you — feel free to submit a booking request!"},
